{"path":"thread/unique_lock/swap","title":"std::unique_lock<Mutex>::swap","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::unique_lock&lt;Mutex&gt;::</span>swap","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/unique_lock/swap","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Exchanges the internal states of the lock objects.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> unique_lock<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Exchanges the internal states of the lock objects.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the lock to swap the state with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;mutex&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/mutex\"><span class=\"kw2175\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mutex</span></span></a> mtx1<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/unique_lock\"><span class=\"kw2188\">std::<span class=\"me2\">unique_lock</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/mutex\"><span class=\"kw2175\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mutex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> guard1<span class=\"br0\">(</span>mtx1<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/unique_lock\"><span class=\"kw2188\">std::<span class=\"me2\">unique_lock</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/mutex\"><span class=\"kw2175\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mutex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> guard2<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    guard2.<span class=\"me1\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>guard1<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>guard1 <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> guard2<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"swapped success<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>swapped success</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/unique_lock/swap2\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>std::swap<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::unique_lock)</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  specializes the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap\">std::swap</a></span> algorithm <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ r